<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67496" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μην-ῡτής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾱνῡτάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶ</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bringing to light</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1051
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>one who brings information</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς μέλλουσιν ἀποθανεῖσθαι μ. γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.32
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.167b
			</span></i>: mostly in legal sense, <i>informer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.132
			</span></i>, etc.; as epith. of Heracles, <u>Vit.Soph</u>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδικήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.2.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κατά τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.24
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σαυτοῦ μ. ἐπὶ τοῖς συμβᾶσι
					γεγονώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.284
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀποκτεινάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					2.4.3
				</span></i>
			; of a woman, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				428
			</span></i>.</div>
